# Repository line-ending policy.
#
# All tracked text is stored LF-normalized in the repository so the object
# store is identical on every platform regardless of a machine's
# core.autocrlf/core.eol settings.
*   text=auto

# Docs and rule files (edited by humans and AI agents alike) checkout as LF
# on every platform so they never flip-flop between LF and CRLF in the
# working tree. Git-for-Windows sets core.autocrlf=true at the system level
# and would otherwise re-inject CRLF into these files on every checkout.
*.md text eol=lf
